{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"21":"Funerals (Kitab Al-Jana'iz)"},"section_detail":{"21":{"hadithnumber_first":3089,"hadithnumber_last":3241,"arabicnumber_first":3089,"arabicnumber_last":3241,"name_native":"كتاب الجنائز"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3167,"arabicnumber":3167,"text":"حدثنا سليمان بن حرب، حدثنا حماد، عن ايوب، عن حفصة، عن ام عطية، قالت نهينا ان نتبع، الجنايز ولم يعزم علينا","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (313) Sahih Muslim (938 After  1491)"}],"reference":{"book":21,"hadith":79}}]}